==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*7 [[Sister Lione]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance attackers]] such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]] and [[Adult Cat (Rare Cat)|Prisoner Cat]] will really help. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] are best against the Sister Liones.

==Trivia==
*Different from the Ad's Japanese name, Osechi Different from the Catalog, is a reference to an [https://www.fastcompany.com/1723996/groupon-not-big-japan-following-unfortunate-osechi-incident-report infamous Groupon scandal] in which people's [[wikipedia:Osechi|osechi]] looked nothing like what they thought they were ordering.

